vault-main.sql is the snapshot schema of the core and full migrations of origin/main commit ea78c5bdaad27148b4134923f04e0f5f94830ea7 (sqlite_master SQL ordered by type and name, FTS shadow tables left out), followed by the schema_migrations versions and a small neutral data set used by the import tests: 3 torrents, 2 sources, 4 acquisitions, 2 follows, release attempts, a pinned release, settings, 2 users, 3 items and 5 files, 1 online_progress row. To rebuild: check out that commit (or the merged tree), run internal/db.Open with GOFLAGS='-tags=sources -modfile=go.full.mod' on an empty file, dump SELECT sql FROM sqlite_master WHERE sql NOT NULL AND name NOT LIKE 'sqlite_%' ORDER BY (type<>'table'), type, name with a trailing semicolon per statement, then append the inserts. Never edit it by hand to follow a newer schema.
